,"all_cited":true,"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>rescue, recover</em>, e.g. cities <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:26\" href=\"/Judges.11.26\">Ju 11:26</a>; wives and property <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.8\">1 S 30:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.22\">22</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>deliver from:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>enemies and troubles</em>, abs. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.21\">1 S 12:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.19\">Pr 19:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.2\">Is 50:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 39:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.39.17\">Je 39:17</a>; †<span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין מַצִּיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:28\" href=\"/Judges.18.28\">Ju 18:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 5:4\" href=\"/Job.5.4\">Jb 5:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 10:7\" href=\"/Job.10.7\">10:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:3\" href=\"/Psalms.7.3\">ψ 7:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:22\" href=\"/Psalms.50.22\">50:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:11\" href=\"/Psalms.71.11\">71:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.29\">Is 5:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.22\">42:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.13\">43:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:4\" href=\"/Daniel.8.4\">Dn 8:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:7\" href=\"/Daniel.8.7\">7</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:14\" href=\"/Hosea.5.14\">Ho 5:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 5:7\" href=\"/Micah.5.7\">Mi 5:7</a>; c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:8\" href=\"/Exodus.18.8\">Ex 18:8</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 5:23\" href=\"/Exodus.5.23\">5:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:27\" href=\"/Exodus.12.27\">12:27</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.15\">Dt 23:15</a> + 39 times; †<span dir=\"rtl\">הַצִּיל נַפְשוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.20\">Is 44